{"case_id":"G01","elapsed_s":0.0005216,"value":{"candidates":[],"candidates_truncated":false,"canonical_status":"canonical","citations":[],"contract_version":"2","descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:1460","original":"Hatsune Miku is a Japanese [[VOCALOID]] developed and distributed by Crypton Future Media, originally released for the VOCALOID2 engine on August 31, 2007. She was the first of the Character Vocal Series and is an official [[Piapro Studio|PIAPRO]] character.\r\n\r\nShe is recognizable by her [[very long hair|very long]] [[aqua hair|aqua]] [[twintails]] and [[aqua eyes]], although she is also commonly depicted with [[blue hair]] and [[blue eyes]]. She wears a [[grey shirt|grey]] or [[white shirt|white]] [[sleeveless shirt|sleeveless]] [[collared shirt]] with an [[aqua necktie|aqua]] or [[blue necktie]], has [[long sleeves|long]] [[black sleeves|black]] [[detached sleeves]], a [[black skirt|black]] [[pleated skirt|pleated]] [[miniskirt]], and [[black boots|black]] [[thigh boots]]. She has a [[number tattoo]] [[shoulder tattoo|on her shoulder]] and square-shaped [[hair ornament]]s.\r\n\r\nShe is voiced by [[Fujita Saki]], and her first appearance was illustrated by [[KEI (Keigarou)|]].\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !post #6549225: Vocaloid2 (2007)\r\n* !post #662258: [[Hatsune Miku (Append)|Append]]\r\n* !post #2050940: [[Hatsune Miku (Vocaloid3)|Vocaloid3]]\r\n* !post #1482524: [[Hatsune Miku (Vocaloid3)|Vocaloid3]] (English)\r\n* !post #2534170: [[Hatsune Miku (Vocaloid4)|Vocaloid4]]\r\n* !post #2860676: [[Hatsune Miku (Vocaloid4) (Chinese)|Vocaloid4 (Chinese)]]\r\n* !post #4427252: [[Hatsune Miku (NT)|NT]]\r\n* !post #7936716: [[Hatsune Miku (SP)|SUPER PACK]]\r\n* !post #10921388: [[Hatsune Miku (Vocaloid6)|Vocaloid6]]\r\n* !post #4638582: [[Hatsune Miku (If)|If]]\r\n* !post #11650134: [[Hatsune Miku (Blue Archive)|Blue Archive]]\r\n\r\nh4. Derivatives\r\n\r\nh5. Officially acknowledged\r\n\r\nh6. Voicebanks\r\n\r\n* Vocaloid2\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Append)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Vocaloid3)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Vocaloid4)]] (V4X)\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Vocaloid4) (Chinese)]] (V4X)\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (NT)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (SP)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Vocaloid6)]]\r\n\r\nSee also: [[Hatsune Miku (voicebank)]]\r\n\r\nh6. [[Project Diva (Series)|]]\r\n\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Ageage Again)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Agitation)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Aile D'ange)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Ambivalence)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Americana)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Angel Module)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Anode Electronica)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Arabian)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Avant-Garde)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Bandaged Heart)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Bless You)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Brilliant Butterfly)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Cabin Attendant)]]\r\n** [[Hatsune Miku (Cabin Attendant Style A)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Cantatrice)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Catch the Wave)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Celebration)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Chat Noir)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Cheer)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Cheerful)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Chinese Debut)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Chopstick)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Chou)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Colorful Drop)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Conductor Nightingale)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Conflict)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Cute Module)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Dancer)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Dark Angel)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (De:Monstar)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Deep Sky)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Dimension)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Dreamer)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Engage)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Etoile)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Factory Tyrant)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Fairy Module)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Farewell)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Fonewearl Style)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Galaxy)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Gallia Gun Dai 7 Shoutai)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Ghost Module)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Gothic Module)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Green Ponpoko)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Ha2ne Miku)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Heart Hunter)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Heartbeat)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Hello Good Night)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Hello World.)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (High Fever)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Holy Goddess)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Honey Whip)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Ichi no Sakura Oka)]]\r\n** [[Hatsune Miku (Ichi no Sakura Shiro Oka)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Infinity)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Innocent)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Ivy Rabbit)]]\r\n* [[Hatsune Miku (Je","response_truncated":true,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"hatsune_miku"}],"evidence_chain":[{"evidence_id":"native:385430","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8.raw","raw_sha256":"4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8","role":"native_identity","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f","tag_id":385430},{"active_alias_ids":[],"coverage":"scoped_complete","evidence_id":"scope:hatsune_miku","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:37.561596+00:00","name":"hatsune_miku","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945.raw","raw_sha256":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","role":"canonical_scope","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f"},{"association":"official embedded tag.wiki_page","evidence_id":"wiki:5655","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8.raw","raw_sha256":"4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8","role":"wiki_tag_link","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f","tag_id":385430,"tag_key":{"kind":"tag","namespace":"danbooru.tag","value":"hatsune_miku"},"wiki_id":5655,"wiki_key":{"kind":"page","namespace":"danbooru.wiki","value":"5655"}},{"bo